        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Maybe Atro's ID badge. She didn't like to wear it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Operator Click, Operator Ayerscarpe, our situation has changed."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_328_cammou"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Click",
        "text": "Y-yeah, I know already!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Click",
        "text": "Since you and Ayers rescued me from the mountain, I'm more than glad to help!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "char_328_cammou",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "Don't call me Ayers... *Sigh*. What has Leonhardt been telling you...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "The Catastrophe was immensely destructive. Wolumonde will not be in better shape now. What were their Catastrophe Messengers doing?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "Things wouldn't have gotten so bad if Leonhardt or Earthspirit was there..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "char_294_ayer",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "No point thinking about that now... we should prepare for the worst."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Any objections to setting up camp outside the town?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_328_cammou"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Click",
        "text": "None whatsoever!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "I am after all a professional Catastrophe Messenger bodyguard. And this is the 'wunderkind' who nearly got herself killed shooting videos deep in the Winterwisp Mountains."
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "char_328_cammou",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Click",
        "text": "Why are you still rubbing salt into my wounded pride?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "char_328_cammou",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "Just kidding. But... GreyThroat wouldn't want us to storm the town and kick in the doors of the mayor's office, would she?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Sorry. Please be patient. I have to confirm what happened to Atro."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "I'll be right back."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
