    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "What is this place..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Sorry about the... hasty handling. But they're mostly Infected. We had to put them somewhere underground to keep the others from panicking."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "...It's cold."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I make sure to keep the refrigeration units running."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Impressive Arts. As to be expected from a Leithanian officer."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Eight victims."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Four from Wolumonde, Dr. Atro, and three Infected outlanders."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Including your son... Mr. Thorwald."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Tatjana told you that too, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "It's true."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Because I wasn't there..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Here you are... Atro."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "You... You really gave me the runaround here... Stupid cat."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Incredible... how can she tell...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "(Could we... give them some space?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
