            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "What is this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "The Arts core of the L-44 'Gramophone' autonomous defense device. To put it bluntly, this is your murder weapon."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Of course, civilians aren't allowed to possess destructive power like this. But any educated Leithanian would know how to drive this core."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Overloading, heating, and igniting are all features of our town's defensive equipment. Originium Arts engineering is complex. Not everyone can use it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "So this is it. Someone used this to kill Atro..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "......."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "We have to find the murderer."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "And then what?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "And then... I'll make them pay."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "How about that. You move past restlessness and sorrow, and you choose revenge."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Miss Folinic... we shouldn't..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "I know."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Of course I know. As a Rhodes Island Operator, as Dr. Kal'tsit's student, I should know better than anyone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "But the murderer, and the murderer alone, must face justice!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "What did Atro do? She was helping the Infected! What did she do to deserve this?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "At least..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "At least let me ask them... I have to know why..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I understand."
    },
