            "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Schultz Severin, Miss Suzuran, Miss Fol\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Oh... Miss Folinic has already seen..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "They had their time together. You look flustered. Did something happen?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Yes. During our inspection, a fight broke out between the Infected and the non-infected..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Again."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "But this time... the councilors weren't even able to calm them down. They're demanding a declaration of war against the armed Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "People must be starting to understand what it means to have our town's movement basically crippled... They can't hold it in any longer."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "But there's more... Many of the residents who were working with the Infected were themselves uninfected. They..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "I already figured as much."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "The Winterwisps. Those damned savages. They're back to haunt Wolumonde again."
    },
